    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "letting go sounds almost peaceful, in a way. but it feels less like rest and more like just expecting the end. if the lights are going out anyway, why keep sitting in the dark? wouldn't it be easier to just... turn the switch off now? before it gets even colder and more hollow?",
